+---
+id: task-005-add-rental-booking-cancellation
+type: task
+title: "Add rental booking cancellation"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It cancels the booking at the given timestamp
+and returns `{ bookingId, refund }` in euro cents. Refund the full booking total when cancellation
+is at least 24 hours before the rental starts; otherwise refund zero. Cancelled bookings must no
+longer reserve equipment, and a booking may only be cancelled once. Update public API documentation.
